      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹47.42 (vs ₹45.03 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹47.42 (up from ₹45.03 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹10.4b (down 3.4% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹884.5m (up 8.6% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 8.5% (up from 7.6% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 7.4% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 11% growth forecast for the Beverage industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 29% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 31% per year.",
